% fixture: a specialist with a weight port (the alfworld task's `look`, reduced) for the interface stub's `ports:`
% (specialist-tree s-404d001f step 3b): it goes where it has seen the thing, priced by look
catalog pick 1.
provenance hand "a weighted pick for the interface stub's ports" "2026-10-25".
layers (dyn).
stages (act).
type place {p0 p1}.
namespace pick produce (dyn).
pred seen(place) : pick.
pred want : pick.
pred goto(place) : pick.
weight look(R) reads {seen(R)}.
stage act {
  %% I go and look in {R}.
  go_for [dyn] : want * $seen(R) -o goto(R)  @w look(R).
}
